ke —\nand carries a <code>vendor_approved</code> flag recording whether we have written\npermission to research or adopt it further.</p>\n<hr>\n<strong>Children</strong>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/ac09f4a5-496c-49be-9396-2d602537468c\">Burtynsky's \"Manufactured Landscapes\" — a counter-example</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/de93244d-d998-494f-b5d1-189b28dbc899\">Conservation photography — raking light</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/605332d0-02ad-4b4c-a636-10a9e9bfd8f0\">Forensic evidence photography — reference scales</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/ea3813a0-0a80-4f6f-ae21-d388eb38832a\">Fritzchens Fritz — delidded die macro photography</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/4854a8a2-d71a-466f-993d-3b34cc46cfc6\">Herbarium specimen imaging — scale and colour calibration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/bc4c10db-a44d-4e17-8e15-30e564fe7c57\">IRIS — infrared, in-situ chip inspection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/4f3e636c-2910-46b3-828f-99c084cc5611\">Installation-view conventions, and artists who push back on them</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/480ab885-61c1-4787-8654-d23b96356ba7\">Zeptobars — decapsulated die-shot archive</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/IntoTheEtherDocumentationDendron/notes/52124973-fc66-4c72-98ad-7456e239bdc3\">iFixit teardown photography</a></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">meta (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">photography (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","noteIndex":{"id":"28a6a50b